comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:17:03.734Z",codex-root,Plan intentionally keeps only the concrete implementation task in progress; the Feature and Plan remain open until terminal delivery.
  "2026-07-25T00:39:32.205Z",codex-root,"Reported core pm plan creation atomicity defect after three duplicate searches: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/688. The failure occurs after persisting a cross-assignee Plan but before seeded steps are applied; it is not caused by a custom extension."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:17:03.734Z",codex-root,Do not trigger a publishing release; only non-publishing dry-run/rehearsal is authorized.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:17:03.734Z",codex-root,Generic WebSocket passthrough remains the forward-compatibility boundary; typed commands target stable documented contracts.
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  src/api/websocket.ts,project,Primary protocol implementation
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,pm_context_mode}:
  "bun run release:verify",project,2400,tracker
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  docs/API.md,project,Canonical command contract
plan_mode: approved
plan_resume_context: "Research is complete. Implement supported_features id 1 negotiation, object/array frame dispatch, and typed subscribe-trigger with inline/file JSON plus variables and bounded capture. Preserve generic passthrough and privacy. Then docs, 100 percent gates, non-publishing rehearsal, PR review loop, merge, and closeout."
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-25T00:17:53.172Z",codex-root,Negotiate coalesce_messages by default after auth and add typed subscribe-trigger while retaining generic ws call.,"This follows the stable official protocol, lowers framing overhead, and keeps forward compatibility for integration-defined commands.",Official WebSocket docs; Core dev connection/http/commands sources; live supported_features and subscribe_trigger success.
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:17:52.008Z",codex-root,"Current client starts application messages at id 1, only parses one JSON object per frame, and offers subscribe_events but not admin subscribe_trigger."
